          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Karnataka's ELEVATE NxT Deep-Tech Programme Draws 983 Applications, Nearly 23% From Outside State",
            "articleSection": "Education & Youth",
            "abstract": "Karnataka's government-backed deep-tech startup programme ELEVATE NxT has received 983 applications, with 213 — nearly 23% — coming from startups outside the state, indicating national appetite for structured deep-tech support. The programme is designed to accelerate startups working on frontier technologies including AI, semiconductors, and advanced engineering. The strong cross-state response signals that India's deep-tech startup ecosystem is maturing beyond Bengaluru's traditional boundaries.",
            "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/karnatakas-deep-tech-programme-elevate-nxt-draws-strong-response-from-startups-across-india/article70946319.ece",
